  "bodyHash": "UBcVZ7mcS+g=",
  "content": "<hr><h1>模組需求（重要）</h1><h4><strong>本模組需要以下組件：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-immersive-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸式軍械庫</a>（tacz 擴充包）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">機械動力</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸工程</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">永恆經典零式</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-immersive-tacz-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">機械動力沉浸式 Tacz 整合</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-create-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">機械動力軍械庫</a>（可選 tacz 擴充包，用於製作機械動力武器）</li>\n</ul><p>若不清楚如何安裝 tacz 武器擴充包，請參閱 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-immersive-tacz-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">機械動力沉浸式 Tacz 整合</a> 頁面中的安裝教學。</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/978675/description_0c80647f-43e3-48ee-bce9-f81d45f49717.png\" alt=\"\"></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本模組為「機械動力沉浸式 Tacz 整合」新增零件與合成配方，以納入沉浸式軍械庫的相關配方。</p><h1><strong>全新槍械配方！</strong></h1><p>由於 TaCZ 武器相較於一般 Minecraft 與機械動力的武器更為強大，我們透過新增的槍械零件重新平衡了合成配方。現在你需要準備精密機械裝置與機械合成器等組件才能製作它們。</p><h2><strong>新型「電磁線圈」軌道手槍配方</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_21b1cea6-8b0f-4410-b0e9-eb3038912252.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2><strong>新型「激發式」自動軌道手槍配方</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_1bc52c00-3099-4d0d-85a8-a58427049268.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><h2><strong>新型「制動式」左輪手槍配方</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_11a87dbe-1008-4a70-820e-b023b8516e0c.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><h2><strong>新型「傳奇」手槍配方</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_118555e5-5ac2-4aaf-accb-aeae3ef2ceea.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><h2><strong>新型「超載式」軌道槍配方</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_782b3daa-3aef-4827-ae21-fd021ef26454.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><h2><strong>新型「逆推式」突擊步槍配方</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_3bba4652-f3cb-46dc-853e-34e12aec169f.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><h2><strong>新型「抑制式」霰彈槍配方</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_1ce472ed-8435-4e16-99f1-7b63227cf064.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><h2><strong>新型「壓制式」雙管霰彈槍配方</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_b1e6d9c3-40e1-46b1-ba48-dd648f51a4ad.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><h2><strong>新型「伺服電路」軌道衝鋒槍配方</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_14e19f6f-b9f1-40cb-ac23-1894108bbf6b.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><h2><strong>新型「蜂鳥式」迷你衝鋒槍配方</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_40047fed-972f-4808-8efc-7101bbef5183.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><h2><strong>新型「淨化式」化學噴射器配方</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_12bfac32-d653-4898-a32f-4c81eeb15482.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><h2><strong>新型「熔解式」電漿槍配方</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_204859d9-0a52-483f-b300-142bdb5e38fc.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><h2><strong>新型「火神式」雙管機砲配方</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_f6f00fbc-4ff9-4692-9dad-efa60725fd7e.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><h1><strong>全新彈殼系統！</strong></h1><p><strong>彈殼</strong>可透過鋸切黃銅板製成。你可以在 JEI 中選擇特定彈殼類型並設定過濾器，使鋸片專門切割對應的板材。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_536d70d5-a54a-46bd-aceb-57d92d434afe.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h1><strong>全新槍械配件配方！</strong></h1><p>一把完整的槍械怎能缺少<strong>配件</strong>？以下為部分範例：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_ccb1e2a4-c984-450a-9dfb-c30ac7734fdd.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_90a94294-a3e9-4981-9a08-c9b18da1d534.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_b22d4e46-b118-415b-a6c1-f82aa5f02355.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_34c7f6ff-e46d-4c66-945c-51c900ba2f5b.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_6d4ecfbc-5df9-4e77-8dfb-41f353e471d1.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_add67988-b925-44bd-9679-0ad8cda7303b.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_5acb2411-649e-4cd3-881c-d29cd4d52141.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_219c3922-1a1b-4bab-b7e8-11f20371f45f.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312134/description_05173650-4705-4e35-b18f-af864f660501.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>若需更多資訊，請造訪 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-immersive-tacz-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">機械動力沉浸式 Tacz 整合</a> 專頁。</p><hr><h1>常見問題</h1><p>問：啟動遊戲時出現錯誤。</p><p>答：請嘗試更新 Forge 至較新版本。</p><p>問：使用鋸子時產出其他物品。</p><p>答：代表有其他模組使用相同配方。請在鋸子中設定過濾器，使其僅輸出你需要的物品。</p><p>本模組最初為個人需求開發，但若您對調整內容有任何建議，歡迎在留言區提出！</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>看看我的其他模組！</strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-mechanical-companion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264989/description_609b037b-78cb-4497-8b4f-c95c77def773.png\" alt=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3eebc495-7c50-4bec-9c5b-43b13ec09ac0.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>想回報錯誤、分享心得、建議功能或獲取遊戲更新嗎？加入我們的官方 Discord 頻道！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jWqsA8EPeC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/978675/description_4336ae1a-a280-4da5-8faa-7588ff631da4.png\" width=\"109\" height=\"109\"></a></p><p>若您喜歡本模組並願意支持開發，我們衷心感謝您的贊助 ❤️<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmarcosjoestar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264989/description_a58064f4-0c7b-475f-b0f8-83767c242bd8.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
